<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id">SONG - Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Nch</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nchemo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Nchemo ntana</para>
  <para style="mt">Nchemo ntana</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Nchemo ntana ni chitabu cha mashaili ya kungana kwa mgosi na mvyele kwa wantu wa Izulaeli kulawana na wata kuwandika walozize. Kwa Chiebulaniya ulosi wa Nchemo ntana ni Nchemo ntana ikulise kujinka zose, saviya, sekulu ywa masekulu, nivyo kugamba seuta mkulu akujinka maseuta wose. Chitabu chikonga kwa kumtambalisa Seuta Solomoni mwe sula ya 1:1, mna sivyo kugamba nuyo awandike ichitabu chino. Iviya vyadahika kugamba chitabu chino chiwandikwa ni mntu msiku kumtunya Solomoni. Wasomile hawamanyize umo ichitabu chino chawandikagwa, mna vyadahika mafani ni mwechipindi Solomoni achei mjima mihilimo ya 970 kubula 931 Kulisito henati kwelekwa, na kuvuzagizwa nyumani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nchemo ntana yatogola kusasamula ungi wa mgosi na mvyele. Kulawana ne chitabu chino, chatambalisa ivyo mgosi na mvyele wakungana nkwina zawo chila yumwenga kwa mnyawe. Iviya ahamwenga wambuya zawo dya awo wakungana wawalangiliza na kulungana nawo mwe ngasu yawo. Sula 1:8. Wasomile walozize wazumila kugamba mbuli nkulu mwe chitabu chino yawoneka mwe sula ya 8 msitale wa 5 kubula msitale wa 7. Aho mvyele agamba ungi una nguvu saviya file. Ungi ni chintu china nguvu chikwivika mndani mo umoyo hukudaha kuchichinda ni saviya file. Mafani nivyo vikuleka wavyele kafunda nkanana ntatu kugamba mntu asekwingila mwe ungi chipindi chakwe hechinati kubula. Sula ya 2:7 na sula 3:5 na sula 8:4.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">1. Mwe sula ya 1:1 Zina chinkigwe ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io">2. Zina dye chitabu dize diwandikwe, chihande cha nkongo che inchemo ino, sula ya 1:2 kubula sula ya 2:7.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Chihande cha kaidi che nchemo ino ni mwe sula ya 2:8 kubula sula ya 3:5.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Chihande cha katatu che nchemo ino ni mwe suala ya 3:6 kubula sula ya 5:1.</para>
  <para style="io">5. Chihande cha kane che nchemo ino ni mwe sula ya 5:2 kubula sula ya 6:3.</para>
  <para style="io">6. Chihande cha shano che nchemo ino ni mwe sula ya 6:4 kubula sula ya 8:4.</para>
  <para style="io">7. Udumo Nchemo ya mtandatu yalongwa mwe sula ya 8:5 kubula sula ya 8:14.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="SNG 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 1:1" />Nchemo ntana ya Solomoni kujinka nchemo zose.<verse eid="SNG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya nkongo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 1:2" />Vibuka mwile imilomo yako ikanibusu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:2">kwaviya ungi wako wanibwedeza ukaleka divai.<verse eid="SNG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 1:3" />Kuhaka mavuta yakupwepweleka vitana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">zina dyako ni saviya mavuta yakupwepweleka yajidigwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">Elo, nivyo vikuleka wandele wakungisa.<verse eid="SNG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 1:4" />Sunguza niguha chihalawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">naunga seuta aniguhe na kunigala kwe ichumba chakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Nachelelwe na kushangiliya kwachausa chakwe. Nachitogole ungi wako ukaleka divai. Havikwehela ukaugwa ni wandele!<verse eid="SNG 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 1:5" />Nyuwe wavyele wa Yelusalemu, miye ni mtitu mna nimtana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">enga amahema ya Kedali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">saviya amapaziya mwe idizumba dya Solomoni.<verse eid="SNG 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 1:6" />Msekunehelwa kwaviya ni mtitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">sitakokwa ni zuwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">Walukolo wangu nendile wanifila maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">niyo wanitenda mwamizi ywa nkonde za mizabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">Elo, sidunduga kutunduliya umwili wangu.<verse eid="SNG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 1:7" />Hake nigambila weye chendegwa cho umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">Izingoto zako nozidimile kuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">Chipindi zuwa hedinati kwakisa nazikatwetele kuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">Ni mbwani miye hulonde mwe mabunga ya wambuyzo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:7">Msozi<verse eid="SNG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 1:8" />Weye wimtana kujinka wavyele wose, uneva humanyize ko kunipata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">timila amawala ye ze izingoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">wabehela wako dimila hajihi na amahema ya awadimi.<verse eid="SNG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 1:9" />Weye chendegwa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:9">nakuliganya na vyele dya falasi dikukwesa lingisha dya falao.<verse eid="SNG 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 1:10" />Sitadi zongeza utana wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:10">ne mikufu ya mayuwe ya yombe kulu mwe singo yako yakuwagila.<verse eid="SNG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 1:11" />Mna nachikudamanyize mikufu ya zahabu, ihahambigwe vyedi kwa chumbu.<verse eid="SNG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mvyele msolwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 1:12" />Umo seuta endile mwe chigoda chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:12">amavuta yangu yapwepweleka chila hantu.<verse eid="SNG 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 1:13" />Chendegwa changu ni saviya mavuta yakupwepweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:13">umo akegoneza mwechifuwa changu chilo chijima.<verse eid="SNG 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 1:14" />Chendegwa changu ni saviya maluwa ya mti ukubwalika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:14">kwe izinkonde ze imizabibu uko Engedi.<verse eid="SNG 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mgosigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 1:15" />Chindedi wi mtana, weye chendegwa changu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:15">Meso yako yalegela.<verse eid="SNG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mvyele msolwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 1:16" />Weye chendegwa changu, chindedi kubuka utana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:16">Mani maisi nayatende nulo ulusazi lwetu,<verse eid="SNG 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 1:17" />izinguzo ze chumba chetu nazitende ni miti ya mihingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:17">misomo naitende ni miti ya mihungwe.<verse eid="SNG 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="SNG 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 2:1" />Miye ni saviya luwa dikulawa Shaloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:1">luwa dibwalike mwe kolongo.<verse eid="SNG 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mgosingwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 2:2" />Saviya ntumba ya luwa mwe mishongoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:2">nivyo chili ichendegwa changu mgati mwa wandele.<verse eid="SNG 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mvyele msolwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 2:3" />Saviya mpela mgati mwe imiti ya kumbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">nivyo eli ichenegwa changu mgati mwa awabwanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">Nelelwa umo hekala hasi he ichizuli chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">ukatenda hajihi na miye nabweda saviya mntu akudya tunda dimwile.<verse eid="SNG 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 2:4" />Kaniguha kubula ko ukumbi we ngasu yo kudya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:4">chila mntu kawona kugamba anunga.<verse eid="SNG 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 2:5" />Sisokezwa ni ungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:5">elo ninula nidindimale, ninka matoloja nisangale.<verse eid="SNG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 2:6" />Mtwi wangu ugonela mkono wakwe wa kumoso na mkono wakwe wa kulume unikubatila.<verse eid="SNG 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 2:7" />Naweila nyuwe wavyele wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">saviya weli wapala ne izimbala za kumbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">msekusasamula hegu kukonkanya ungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">kubula aho ichipindi chakwe nachibule.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="SNG 2:7">Nchemo ya kaidi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="SNG 2:7">Mvyele msolwa<verse eid="SNG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 2:8" />Tegeleza, idyo ni izwi dya chendegwa changu, asunguza kwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">apilika kwa amagulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">awagulu awajinka kwa nguluko.<verse eid="SNG 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 2:9" />Chendegwa changu ni saviya kapala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">ni saviya mwala mbala Kachimala hajihi ne chiwambaza asungila mwe dilisha chani awone kundani.<verse eid="SNG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 2:10" />Chendegwa changu anigamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:10">“Inuka chite weye chendegwa changu ukuniwagila, so chite zetu.<verse eid="SNG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 2:11" />Kaula chipindi cha mpeho chijinka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:11">fula nazo zikanta kale,<verse eid="SNG 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 2:12" />maluwa yabwalika chila hantu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">Chino ni chipindi cha kuchema nchemo za mbwedo, izwi dya wadege dyevika chila hantu kwezinkonde.<verse eid="SNG 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 2:13" />Mikuyu ikonga kweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">mizabibu ibwalika, yalavya mhembe wedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">Elo, so weye chendegwa changu ukuniwagila, so chite.<verse eid="SNG 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 2:14" />Weye nisaviya kasuwamanga, kefisize kwe izinyuwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">Hake leka niwone uso wako, hake longa nive idizwi dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">kwaviya izwi dyako dyelela na uso wako watamila.<verse eid="SNG 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 2:15" />Wagosi watuhu wesaviya mauzi madodo, usekuleka wakanebunga.”<verse eid="SNG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mvyele msolwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 2:16" />Chendegwa changu ni changu, miye nami ni ywakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:16">Uyo adimila izingoto zakwe he luwa dya mayungiyungi,<verse eid="SNG 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 2:17" />Uya enga kapala weye chendegwa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">kubula aho zuwa dikatontomoka ne ichizuli kusika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">Saviya mbala kulanga kwa amagulu ya Beteli.<verse eid="SNG 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="SNG 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 3:1" />Nechilo hatenda mo lusazi lwangu, silota nalonda chendegwa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:1">simlonda mgosi uyo mna simuwone.<verse eid="SNG 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 3:2" />Niyo nenuka nazunguluka komzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">silonda mwesila na mwe izinkikwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">namlonda yudya hungisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">Simlonda mgosi uyo mna simuwone.<verse eid="SNG 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 3:3" />Wamizi wo umzi niyo waniwona, umo wakauzunguluka umzi. Niyo nawauza, “Togolani mumuwona yudya humungisa mo umoyo wangu?”<verse eid="SNG 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 3:4" />Ahadya nize niwakande mgongo niyo namuwona chendegwa cho umoyo wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">Niyo namtoza simlekele ahalawe, simwigala kukaya kwa mnala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">kubula kwa yudya aneleke.<verse eid="SNG 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 3:5" />Naweilani nyuwe wavyele wa Yelusalemu, nelisa kwa wapala na mbala, msekusasamula hegu kukonkanya ungi, kubula hadya chipindi chakwe nachibule.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="SNG 3:5">Nchemo ya katau</para>
  <para style="p" vid="SNG 3:5">Mvyele msolwa<verse eid="SNG 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 3:6" />Ni chintu chani chiya chikulaila kwedijangwa chikwinga mnala wa mosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">chikunukiya mavuta na ubani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">mavunkizo yakutagwa ni wachuluzi?<verse eid="SNG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 3:7" />Solomoni eza, kakwezwa mwe chigoda chakwe cho uzumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:7">kazungulukwa ni wamizi milongo mtandatu, wagomba nkondo wakankalu vitendese wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="SNG 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 3:8" />Chila mgomba nkondo katoza sime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">Chila yumwenga ni mkankalu ywa nkondo. Chila yumwenga katoza sime mo umkono wakwe, kemalanya ebungane na mnkondo ywa nechilo.<verse eid="SNG 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 3:9" />Seuta Solomoni kenulwa mwe chigoda chidamanywe kwa mbawo ntana zilaile Lebanoni.<verse eid="SNG 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 3:10" />Nguzo zakwe zidamanywa kwa chumbu na kuhambwa kwa zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">chigoda chakwe chigubikwa vitambala vizambalau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">visumigwe ni wavyele wa Yelusalemu kwa ungi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">wachisumila vilagiso vikulagisa ungi.<verse eid="SNG 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 3:11" />Fosani nyuwe wavyele wa Sayuni, mkauleni seuta Solomoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">Kavala chilemba avaligwe n nine zuwa dye nyinka yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">zuwa diya amemaga mbwedo.<verse eid="SNG 3:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="SNG 4" />
  <para style="s">Mgosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 4:1" />Weye chendegwa changu kubuka utana, chindedi wi mtana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">Meso yako yalegela kwa ungi, yagubikwe kwe suche yako ye inyinka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">fili zako zapepeya saviya fyo dya mbuzi zikusela mo ulugulu lwa Giliyadi.<verse eid="SNG 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 4:2" />Meno yako yang'ala chwee saviya ngoto zikantigwe mazoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">zikuseleza zikulawa kwe kogeswa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">Chila imwenga yeleka mapacha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">hahana hata ngoto imwenga ichedu.<verse eid="SNG 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 4:3" />Milomo yako ni saviya lepe dinkundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">laka dyako dyatamila vidala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">Funda zako zigubikwe chilemba ni saviya chihande cha komamanga, kunyuma kwe isuche yako ye inyinka.<verse eid="SNG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 4:4" />Singo yako yenga mnala wa Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">uzengigwe chintanda vileke wekiye viziha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">mlanga mwakwe mtungikwa nchinga elufu imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">zose ni za wakankalu.<verse eid="SNG 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 4:5" />Matombo yako ni matana saviya wapala wapacha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:5">wakudimwa he tumba dya luwa dya yungiyungi.<verse eid="SNG 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 4:6" />Nanikale ko ulugulu lukulawa mavuta yakwitangwa manemane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:6">kagulu kakulavya ubani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:6">kubula aho na kuche ne chiza kusika.<verse eid="SNG 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 4:7" />Chendegwa changu chindedi kubuka utana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:7">weye huna lema dyodyose.<verse eid="SNG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 4:8" />Weye msolwa ywangu chikulawe Lebanoni, so hamwenga na miye kulawa Lebanoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">Sela kulawa kwe ichinenegwe cha Amana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">kulawa kwe ivinenengwe vya Senili na Helimoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">uko kwekalwa ni simba na suwi.<verse eid="SNG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 4:9" />Kuubwedeza umoyo wangu msolwa ywangu, mkazangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">kunibwedeza umoyo wangu, kunipyasa ziso lumwenga du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">mkufu uwo uvaile mwe singo yako, sahwase.<verse eid="SNG 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 4:10" />Msolwa ywangu ungi wako ubuka mwile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">Wimwile kujinka divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">mhembe wako wanukiya kujinka mavuta yose.<verse eid="SNG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 4:11" />Msolwa ywangu, milomo yako yatweka uchi, lulimi lwako luna mwile enga uchi uhangane na mele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">Mhempe wedi we izisuche zako ni saviya mti wa mwelezi wa Lebanoni.<verse eid="SNG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 4:12" />Msolwa ywangu, ni saviya chibuta chizungulusizwe gwegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">kamto kazibigwe, sokwe ijeligwe hula, umo mtu mtuhu hakudaha kunywa mazi.<verse eid="SNG 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 4:13" />Weye wi saviya chibuta cha mikomamanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">china matunda yedi kujinka yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">Iviya mwe chibuta mna hina na nado,<verse eid="SNG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 4:14" />na zafalani na mchaichai na mdalasini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">manemane na udi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">ne imimeya mituhu ina mpofa yedi.<verse eid="SNG 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 4:15" />Weye wisaviya sokwe mwe chibuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:15">sima dya mazi yo ujima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:15">wamto wakujuluzika mazi kulawa kwa kagulu ka Lebanoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:15">Mvyelengwa<verse eid="SNG 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 4:16" />Inuka weye nkung'unto ya chenya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">Nkung'unto ya kwamwenyemzi vilani mlanga mwe chibuta changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">umemezeni ulanga kwa mhempe wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">Chendegwa changu neze mwe chibuta chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">adye matunda yakwe yedi kujinka yose.<verse eid="SNG 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="SNG 5" />
  <para style="s">Mgosi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 5:1" />Nengila mwe chibuta changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">mkazangu hungisa, msolwa ywangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">Nachisanya mavuta ya manemane na vilungo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">nadya chivuna changu cha uchi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">nanywa divai yangu na mele yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">Mvyele msolwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">Dyani nyuwe wambuya zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">nywani, nywelesani nyuwe huwongisani.<verse eid="SNG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 5:2" />Nasigona mna umoyo wangu nendile haugonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">izwi dye ichendegwe changu dyatowa hodi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">Nivugwila mkazangu chendegwa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">wisaviya kasuwamanga kangu hwine lema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">Mtwi wangu uchabala mnyuzu ifili zangu zichabala mawaga ya chilo.<verse eid="SNG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 5:3" />Sivula kale izisuche zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">nizivale vituhu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">Viga vyangu sivihaka kale, kwambwani nivijele uzavu naho?<verse eid="SNG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 5:4" />Aho chendegwa changu niyo akufya ulwivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:4">umoyo wangu ni wamema mbwedo kwaviya ehajihi.<verse eid="SNG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 5:5" />Niyo nenuka namvuguila chendegwa changu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">Imikono yangu imema mavuta yakupwepweleka ya manemane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">wadole wangu wajuluzika mavuta ya manemane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">nize ntoze umhindo nivugule ulwivi.<verse eid="SNG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 5:6" />Niyo namvuguila chendegwa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">mna kumbe nendile kahalawa kale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">Moyo wangu nendile welelwa umo akakatowa hodi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">Simlonda mna simuwone, moyo wangu niyo wafa chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">simwitanga mna hanitike.<verse eid="SNG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 5:7" />Awamizi wo umzi nendile waniwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">umo wakazunguluka umzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">wanitowa na kunilumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">awamizi we inchili wanihoka isuche yangu ye inyinka.<verse eid="SNG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 5:8" />Naweilani nyuwe wavyele wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">mnamuwona chendegwa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">mgambileni nalumwa kwa ungi wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">Wavyele wa Yelusalemu<verse eid="SNG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 5:9" />Weye uyo ukulonda ni mtana kujinka wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">kwani uyo chendegwa ywako anachibwani chitendese kujinka watuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">chendegwa mtuhu vikuleka wacheila seivyo?<verse eid="SNG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 5:10" />Chendegwa changu ni mtana naho ni mta nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:10">kamanyikisa mgati mwa wagosi elufu mlongo umwenga.<verse eid="SNG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 5:11" />Umtwi wakwe ni mtana enga zahabu ntana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:11">fili zakwe ni zekonya konya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:11">ni ntitu chii enga kungulu.<verse eid="SNG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 5:12" />Meso yakwe yenga ya kasuwamanga hampezo he kamto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:12">ni saviya wasuwamanga wahakile mele hampezo he mto.<verse eid="SNG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 5:13" />Funda zakwe ni saviya chibuta chimemile mavuta ya manemane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">Milomo yakwe ni saviya luwa dya yungiyungi, ichabala mavuta ya manemane yakupwepweleka.<verse eid="SNG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 5:14" />Mikono yakwe izilingana vyedi ni saviya nkome ya zahabu, ihambigwe kwa zabalajadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">Umwili wakwe ni saviya ugoli wa ntembo uhambigwe kwa mayuwe ya yakuti samawati.<verse eid="SNG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 5:15" />Iviga vyakwe ni saviya nguzo za mayuwe ya alabasita zizikigwe mwe vyegamo vya zahabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">Awoneka saviya lugulu ya Lebanoni luna miti ikwitangwa mielezi.<verse eid="SNG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 5:16" />Mlomo wakwe umema milosi imwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">Awagila mwe chila chintu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">Nivyo eli chendegwa changu, heyey nivyo eli mbuyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">nyuwe wavyele wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="SNG 5:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="SNG 6" />
  <para style="q">Wavyelengwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 6:1" />Weye mvyele mtana vitendese</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">uyo chendegwa ywako kaita kuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">Kahinga na kuhi vileke chikwambize kumlonda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">Mvyelengwa<verse eid="SNG 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 6:2" />Chendegwa changu kaita kwe chibuta chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">hantu aho hakutima miti ya lihani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">Uyo adima izingoto zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">na kuchisanya ntumba za maluwa.<verse eid="SNG 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 6:3" />Miye ni ywakwe chendegwa changu, naye ni ywangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:3">uyo adima azingoto zakwe hantu hana ntumba za maluwa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="SNG 6:3">Nchemo ya shano</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:3">Mgosingwa<verse eid="SNG 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 6:4" />Chendegwa changu weye wi mtana enga mzi wa Tiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">wawagiza saviya Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">watisa enga wagomba nkondo wata bendela.<verse eid="SNG 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 6:5" />Hampu usekunisinya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">ukanisinya nawona soni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">Izifili zako ni saviya fyo dya mbuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">zikuseleza hasi ha amagulu ya Giliyadi.<verse eid="SNG 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 6:6" />Ameno yako ni saviya bunga dya ngoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">zikuseleza zize ziheze kogeswa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">Chila imwenga yeleka mapacha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">naho hahana hata imwenga ichedu.<verse eid="SNG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 6:7" />Funda zako zigubikwa suche ya nyinka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:7">ni ntana saviya mabesu maidi ya komamanga.<verse eid="SNG 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 6:8" />Seuta adaha atende na wavyele milongo mtandatu na wasuntaviya milongo mnane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">na wandele hewekuwazika! Mna weye notende ywa nkongo<verse eid="SNG 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 6:9" />Mna kasuwamanga kangu, mtana ywangu ni yumwenga du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">uyo aungiswa ni nine, ni ywe ichedu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">Wandele wamsinya na kumwitanga mjimbikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">wakaza maseuta na wasuntaviya wamtogola.<verse eid="SNG 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 6:10" />Ni yuhi yuno akusinya enga ulangazi wa mtondo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">Ni mtana enga mnenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">apulika saviya zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">atogolwa saviya wagomba nkondo wata bendela.<verse eid="SNG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 6:11" />Siseleza kwe chibuta che imiti ikwitangwa milozi, sita sakukaula miti ikusuka mwedikolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">niwone hegu imizabibu isuka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">uneva imikomamanga ibwalika.<verse eid="SNG 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 6:12" />Sinati kukombaganya chikulaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:12">chendegwa changu kanitanga mwe lingisha dya nkondo.<verse eid="SNG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wavyele wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 6:13" />Vina, vina weye mchiche ulaile Shulami.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:13">Uya, uya chani chikusinye.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="SNG 6:13">Mvyelengwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:13">Ni mbwani mwaunga kunisinya miye mchiche kulawa Shulami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:13">saviya mwasinya ngoma ikuvinwa ni wantu mwe misitale midi?<verse eid="SNG 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="SNG 7" />
  <para style="q">Mgosingwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 7:1" />Izinyayo zako mwe vilatu zawagila vidala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">Weye mchiche ywa chiseuta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">Viga vizilingana enga johali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">ndima idamanywe msani adahise.<verse eid="SNG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 7:2" />Lukuvu lwako ni saviya bakuli heikuswesa divai ihanganywe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">Inda yako ni saviya chisa dya ngano dizungulukwe ni tumba dya luwa.<verse eid="SNG 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 7:3" />Matombo yako ni saviya wapala mapacha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">yenga wana mbala waidi.<verse eid="SNG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 7:4" />Isingo yako ni saviya ugoli wa ntembo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">ameso yako ni saviya mnala mo umzi wa Heshiboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">hajihi no ulwivi lwa Betilabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">Impula yako ni saviya mnala wa Lebanoni, ukuhinga komzi wa Damesiki.<verse eid="SNG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 7:5" />Mtwi wako winukila enga lugulu lwa Kalimeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">fili zako ntana vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">utana wako wadaha kumgwiza hata seuta.<verse eid="SNG 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 7:6" />Weye wimtana naho watamila!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:6">Chendegwa changu mchiche weye kuwagizwa!<verse eid="SNG 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 7:7" />Umwili wako wawagiza enga mtende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:7">matombo yako ni saviya kole dya ntende.<verse eid="SNG 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 7:8" />Nasilonga nanikwele umtende na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">kutungula amakole ye zintende.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">Matombo yako kwangu ni saviya vikocha vya zabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">umuye wako ukahema ni saviya mpofa ya matoloja,<verse eid="SNG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 7:9" />milomo yako ni saviya divai imwile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">Elo, divai ijuluzike kubula kwe chendegwa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">ijinkile mlanga mwe imilomo yakwe na mwa ameno yakwe.<verse eid="SNG 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 7:10" />Miye ni ywakwe chendegwa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:10">naye aniwona kwina vidala.<verse eid="SNG 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 7:11" />So weye chendegwa changu, chite kwezinkonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:11">chite zetu chikagone uko kwevijiji.<verse eid="SNG 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 7:12" />Nachisunguze kwinuka mtondo, chite kwe izinkone ze imizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">chikakaule hegu imizabibu ikonga kusuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">hegu amaluwa ye imizabibu yakonga kubwalika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">ne imikomamanga iviya ikonga kubwalika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">Uko nuko nahwinke ungi wangu.<verse eid="SNG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 7:13" />Masofu yalavya mhempe wedi umemile mlanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">hajihi ne izinyivi zetu hana chila tunda dyedi nounge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">mahya na yachikale ya chila namna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">ayo yose sikwikiya weye chendegwa changu.<verse eid="SNG 7:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="SNG 8" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 8:1" />Nahabesa wendile mlukolo ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">onkezwe mwa matombo ya mame.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">Elo, hata nadugane na weye kuse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">nasikwinka busu na hahana yoyose afanyanye kugamba nadamanya vihiye.<verse eid="SNG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 8:2" />Nasikulongoza na kukubuza kunyumba kwa mame mwelesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">uyo anihinyize ungi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">Nasikunywea divai ikwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">nasikwinka divai yangu ya makomamanga.<verse eid="SNG 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 8:3" />Mkono wako wa kumoso utoza ichilevu changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:3">umkono wako wakulume wanikubatila.<verse eid="SNG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 8:4" />Naweilani nyuwe wavyele wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">msekusasamula hegu kukonkanya ungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">kubula aho ichipindi chakwe nachibule.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="SNG 8:4">Nchemo ya mtandatu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">Wavyelengwa<verse eid="SNG 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 8:5" />Ni yuhi yuno akwiza kulawa kwenyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">kuno kamwegamila chendegwa chakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">Mvyelengwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">Hasi he mti wa mpela uwonelwe usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">hantu welekelwe.<verse eid="SNG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 8:6" />Nimamatiza enga hula mo umoyo wako, heye saviya hula mwe imikono yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">Kwaviya ungi una nguvu enga file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">wivu ni mkali saviya mbila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">Kulibuka kwakwe ni saviya kulibuka kwa moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">waka enga mwale wa moto.<verse eid="SNG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 8:7" />Mazi yalozize hayakudaha kuukoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">mabohwelo ya mazi hayakudaha kuudidimiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">Uneva mntu analavya ugoli wakwe wose mnyumba kwachausa cha ungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">icho akunga apate nu ubezi uwodu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">Walukolo wa mvyelengwa<verse eid="SNG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 8:8" />Suwe china lumbu dyetu mdodo, henati kuhota matombo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">Togola chimdamanyize mbwani lumbu dyetu zuwa nalombwe?<verse eid="SNG 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 8:9" />Endile chiwambaza nachimzengela mnala wa chumbu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">endile lwivi nachimwika kwa mbawo za mielezi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">Mvyelengwa<verse eid="SNG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 8:10" />Miye nanisaviya chiwambaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">matombo yangu nisaviya minala yakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">Akaniwona nendaga saviya mta kuleta utondowazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">Mgosingwa<verse eid="SNG 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 8:11" />Solomoni endaga na nkonde ya mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">hantu hakwitangwa Baalihamoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">Niyo aikodisha kwa walimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">chila mntu alavye vihande elufu imwenga vya chumbu.<verse eid="SNG 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 8:12" />Inkonde yangu ye imizabibu ni yangu miye mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">heye ni nkonde yangu mwenyemwenye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">Elo, weye Solomoni ikala ne izielufu zako ze chumbu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">na awo walimi wa matunda chila yumwenga enkigwe magana maidi yakwe.<verse eid="SNG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 8:13" />Weye ukwikala kwenkonde wambuyazo wetegeleza izwi dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">hake leka nami nidyetegekeze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">Mvyelengwa<verse eid="SNG 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 8:14" />Sunguza wize weye chendegwa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:14">guluka wize kwangu saviya kapala kakuguluka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:14">kulanga kwe magulu yana miti ya vilungo vikupwepweleka.<verse eid="SNG 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 8" />
</usx>